    "title": {
      "rendered": "Katherine Stoneman"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Katherine Stoneman is a senior from Fitchburg, Wis., with a double major in philosophy and quantitative economics. When she’s not in the Mess office, Katherine is the President of the Mock Trial team and is co-founder and President of the Philosophia club on campus. In her free time, she enjoys being outside, listening to music, drawing and hanging out with friends. After graduation, she hopes to work in sports journalism or business, or to continue in school and become a professor.</p>\n",
