    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Jade Jimenez is a junior from Houston, Texas! In her spare time, Jade loves going to art galleries, creating art and writing letters. After college, she hopes to become a Visual Arts teacher, become trilingual and possibly go to grad school or get a PhD. One day, she hopes to sell her artworks and create her own comic.</p>\n",
