    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Daniel Lin is currently a freshman from New York (not the city, though everyone keeps asking). He is from Long Island, New York. He enjoys driving, sightseeing and listening to music. Outside of classes, he usually enjoys the peace at the library or can be seen strolling throughout campus at extreme hours of the night.</p>\n",
