    "id": 37025,
    "title": {
      "rendered": "Emily James"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Hi! Emily is a first-year from Janesville, Minn., planning to major in English. When she&#8217;s not focused on newspaper-related activities (reading, writing and photography), she drags herself to yoga at 7 a.m. sharp on Wednesdays, politics and pastries at 8:30 a.m. on Fridays and learns ASL on Thursdays (at the very normal time of 6 p.m.). Chai lattes from the Cage are her absolute favorite morning boost on those early days!</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
