    "title": {
      "rendered": "Jenn Lin"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Jenn Lin is a film and media studies &amp; Asian studies major from Woodbury, Minn. In her spare time, you&#8217;ll see her journaling, exploring many local art and vintage markets, thrifting, sewing, upcycling clothing and embroidering. After graduation, she hopes to pursue being a producer for a TV station or a multimedia journalist, with an upcycled clothing business on the side!</p>\n",
      "protected": false
