      "rendered": "<p>Eliana Idzikowski is a junior film and media Studies and environmental studies double major from Milwaukee, WI. She loves crafting and reading. When she isn&#8217;t being creative, you can catch her with a frisbee in hand! They love playing for St.Olaf Vortex and spend lots of time watching frisbee.</p>\n",
