    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Julia Sikorski Roehsner is a junior from Minneapolis, Minn., majoring in English and creative writing with a concentration in gender and sexuality studies. She has been writing and drawing since she was little and hopes to publish a novel someday. In her spare time, she also enjoys reading, baking and ballroom dance.</p>\n",
