    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Annie McMullen is a senior environmental studies, Norwegian and Nordic studies major from St. Paul, Minn. On the off chance that she’s not writing something for the Mess or otherwise, she can generally be found walking through the Natural Lands or seeking out new music to obsess over. After St. Olaf, she hopes to continue her studies at graduate or law school.</p>\n",
      "protected": false
