      "rendered": "Lizzie Elsenpeter"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Lizzie Elsenpeter is a senior from Blaine, Minn., majoring in English with a concentration in environmental studies. In her free time, Lizzie enjoys climbing, hiking and exploring nature. After graduation, she plans to combine both her majors and pursue environmental communications or journalism.</p>\n",
