      "rendered": "Juliet Stouffer"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Juliet Stouffer is a senior triple majoring in creative writing, English and film and media studies. She has been writing since age 5, creating short stories and picture books. In fifth grade, she wrote her first full-length chapter book. She is currently working on a book series and several film scripts she hopes to direct. In her free time, she serves as president of the Writers Guild and the Film Production Society.</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
