      "rendered": "Jacob Rozell"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Jacob Rozell is a senior finishing an Individual major in Arctic Studies. As the visual director, he loves art on campus, working with the Mess team, drawing comics and taking photos! You can find him in the DISCO with a house-music playlist or fly-fishing in the rivers and streams of southeast Minnesota.</p>\n",
