    "title": {
      "rendered": "Kathryn Looney"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<p>Kathryn is a senior double major in history and English. Outside the newsroom, she can be found meandering through the natural lands, dialing in on the 5th floor of Rolvaag, reading biographies of saints, or enjoying a little treat (a twist ice cream cone) from the Pause. After graduation, Kathryn plans to join a community of religious sisters, and she is currently discerning with the Sisters of Life in New York.</p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
